        "坐标变换",
        "球面坐标"
      ],
      "question_type": "计算题",
      "method": [
        "直接代入变换公式",
        "逆变换验证"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "计算径向距离 $r$",
        "计算极角 $\\theta$",
        "计算方位角 $\\phi$",
        "进行正变换验证"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "point_conversion",
        "template": "给定直角坐标点，求其球面坐标表示",
        "variable_count": 3
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "坐标变换计算",
          "steps": [
            "计算 $r = \\sqrt{1^2 + (\\sqrt{3})^2 + 2^2} = \\sqrt{1 + 3 + 4} = \\sqrt{8} = 2\\sqrt{2}$",
            "",
            "计算 $\\theta = \\arccos\\left(\\frac{z}{r}\\right) = \\arccos\\left(\\frac{2}{2\\sqrt{2}}\\right) = \\arccos\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right) = \\arccos\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) = \\frac{\\pi}{4}$",
            "",
            "计算 $\\phi = \\mathrm{atan2}(\\sqrt{3}, 1) = \\arctan(\\sqrt{3}) = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$",
            "",
            "因此球面坐标为 $(r, \\theta, \\phi) = (2\\sqrt{2}, \\frac{\\pi}{4}, \\frac{\\pi}{3})$",
            "",
            "验证（正变换）：",
            "- $x = 2\\sqrt{2}\\sin(\\pi/4)\\cos(\\pi/3) = 2\\sqrt{2} \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} = 1$ ✓",
            "- $y = 2\\sqrt{2}\\sin(\\pi/4)\\sin(\\pi/3) = 2\\sqrt{2} \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} = \\sqrt{3}$ ✓",
            "- $z = 2\\sqrt{2}\\cos(\\pi/4) = 2\\sqrt{2} \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} = 2$ ✓"
          ]
        }
      ],
